WEBVTT

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:19.844
[Robotnik]
Please, Grampsy,

00:00:20.018 --> 00:00:21.759
don't do this!

00:00:21.933 --> 00:00:24.022
Sorry, kiddo.

00:00:24.196 --> 00:00:27.417
Bring Your Grandkid to Work Day
is over.

00:00:27.591 --> 00:00:28.635
[device beeping]

00:00:28.809 --> 00:00:30.898
[air whistling]

00:00:31.073 --> 00:00:33.423
[yelping]

00:00:33.597 --> 00:00:35.381
Any last words?

00:00:35.555 --> 00:00:38.254
Just one thing...

00:00:39.255 --> 00:00:41.344
that I never thought I'd say.

00:00:41.518 --> 00:00:42.997
What is it?

00:00:43.172 --> 00:00:45.652
"I love you"?

00:00:46.305 --> 00:00:47.611
No.

00:00:47.785 --> 00:00:49.700
It was something even better.

00:00:49.874 --> 00:00:51.963
But I'm not gonna say it
if that's the way
you're gonna be.

00:00:52.137 --> 00:00:54.096
Okay. Bye.

00:00:55.097 --> 00:00:57.099
[screaming]

00:01:01.407 --> 00:01:03.714
[cackling]

00:01:03.888 --> 00:01:04.845
[hissing inhale]

00:01:05.019 --> 00:01:06.064
[happy grunt]

00:01:06.978 --> 00:01:08.849
Grandchildren.

00:01:09.023 --> 00:01:12.636
All the fun
and none of the responsibility.

00:01:14.768 --> 00:01:17.554
Who said life was pointless?

00:01:18.337 --> 00:01:21.253
- Huh?
- Oh, right. You did.

00:01:21.427 --> 00:01:22.602
[growls][electricity buzzes]

00:01:22.776 --> 00:01:24.387
[screams]

00:01:25.605 --> 00:01:26.911
[faint zap]

00:01:27.085 --> 00:01:28.608
[Tails, Knuckles cheering][Knuckles] Victory!

00:01:28.782 --> 00:01:31.133
Say what you want
about my granddad,

00:01:31.307 --> 00:01:33.135
he made one
hell of a bug zapper.

00:01:33.961 --> 00:01:35.180
[groans softly]

00:01:35.354 --> 00:01:37.182
We got to stop that laser!

00:01:37.356 --> 00:01:39.576
I knew there was something
I was forgetting.

00:01:50.152 --> 00:01:53.329
We're out of time.
The cannon is about to fire!

00:01:53.503 --> 00:01:54.721
Where are you?

00:01:54.895 --> 00:01:57.420
Oh, you know,
just making friends.

00:01:57.594 --> 00:01:59.291
They're all yours.

00:02:02.903 --> 00:02:04.557
[laughing]

00:02:07.995 --> 00:02:09.519
[Sonic] Follow me!

00:02:15.612 --> 00:02:18.180
Now, this might hurt a little!

00:02:19.398 --> 00:02:21.618
[all exclaiming]

00:02:32.019 --> 00:02:34.805
So this was your plan?

00:02:34.979 --> 00:02:36.502
[straining] Yeah...

00:02:36.676 --> 00:02:40.158
Would someone mind
shutting down
the giant death ray?

00:02:42.595 --> 00:02:44.423
We can't stop the cannon
from firing...

00:02:44.597 --> 00:02:46.686
But we can steer it away
from the Earth.

00:02:46.860 --> 00:02:49.211
- Coming around to starboard.
- Aye-aye, Doc.

00:02:53.171 --> 00:02:55.217
Here we go.

00:02:56.435 --> 00:02:58.263
[Tails grunting][Robotnik] It's a little tight.

00:02:59.046 --> 00:03:01.266
Definitely not power steering.

00:03:07.185 --> 00:03:10.101
Keep... turning.[straining]

00:03:12.712 --> 00:03:14.540
Jump in anytime here, guys!

00:03:14.714 --> 00:03:15.846
[all straining]

00:03:16.020 --> 00:03:17.500
[steady beeping]

00:03:20.198 --> 00:03:24.028
Can't... hold... much... longer.

00:03:24.202 --> 00:03:26.160
[all yelling]

00:03:28.075 --> 00:03:29.903
[exhausted groan]

00:03:33.342 --> 00:03:34.952
[groans]

00:03:41.654 --> 00:03:42.786
Yes![cheering]

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:45.223
I did it! I did it!

00:03:48.531 --> 00:03:50.228
- Oh!
- Ooh!

00:03:50.881 --> 00:03:52.012
Look what you did!

00:03:52.186 --> 00:03:54.798
- Hey, look down there!
- Sonic!

00:04:00.891 --> 00:04:02.980
Oh, Knuckles,
please tell me you have a--

00:04:03.154 --> 00:04:04.851
Last one.

00:04:05.025 --> 00:04:06.418
Let's make it count.

00:04:08.986 --> 00:04:11.031
Ready for a little base of ball?

00:04:12.076 --> 00:04:13.686
Deep breath.

00:04:13.860 --> 00:04:16.559
One... two... three!

00:04:17.603 --> 00:04:20.084
[Knuckles grunting]

00:04:20.258 --> 00:04:21.651
[yells]

00:04:36.927 --> 00:04:38.232
[shocked yell]

00:04:38.407 --> 00:04:40.539
- Really!
- What's happening?

00:04:40.713 --> 00:04:43.194
The reactor core is overloading.

00:04:43.368 --> 00:04:45.718
It's only a matter of time
before it blows.

00:04:45.892 --> 00:04:47.633
So what does that mean
for Earth?

00:04:47.807 --> 00:04:50.462
A radioactive atmosphere.

00:04:50.636 --> 00:04:53.117
Rain that kills the crops
and melts your flesh.

00:04:53.291 --> 00:04:54.553
Other than that...

00:04:54.727 --> 00:04:56.381
We're not done here!

00:04:56.555 --> 00:04:58.470
You try to stabilize
the reactor.

00:04:58.644 --> 00:04:59.863
Buy me some time.

00:05:00.037 --> 00:05:02.082
I'll push the station
away from Earth

00:05:02.256 --> 00:05:03.693
before it explodes.

00:05:03.867 --> 00:05:07.871
This is our last chance
to do the right thing.

00:05:09.525 --> 00:05:12.136
[in Spanish]
Go with God

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:14.530
stinking hedgehog.

00:05:15.792 --> 00:05:18.098
[female computer voice]
<i>Core integrity failing.</i>

00:05:27.281 --> 00:05:28.935
I've got you, Sonic!

00:05:30.937 --> 00:05:32.112
[gasps]

00:05:32.286 --> 00:05:33.897
[moans]

00:05:40.556 --> 00:05:41.992
[straining]

00:06:02.273 --> 00:06:05.668
[computer] <i>Initializing
reactor core stabilizers.</i>

00:06:24.382 --> 00:06:27.080
This is Doctor Ivo Robotnik,

00:06:27.254 --> 00:06:29.996
dedicating my final livestream

00:06:30.170 --> 00:06:32.912
to one very special henchman:

00:06:33.522 --> 00:06:34.914
<i>Agent Stone.</i>

00:06:35.088 --> 00:06:37.308
No, no. Doctor, wait!

00:06:37.482 --> 00:06:39.876
<i>If I can't
rule the world...</i>

00:06:40.877 --> 00:06:42.705
I might as well save it...

00:06:42.879 --> 00:06:46.012
for the one and only person
who ever cared about me.

00:06:46.186 --> 00:06:48.101
Don't do this, Doctor, please!

00:06:48.275 --> 00:06:51.888
Stone, you were more
than a sycophant to me.

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:56.022
You were...

00:06:57.502 --> 00:06:59.025
a syco-friend.

00:07:04.596 --> 00:07:08.121
I'll miss your lattes
with steamed Austrian goat milk.

00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:11.951
I love the way you make 'em!

